{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y4Z2ettXcjyEN4adqAJJWi","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Worker return: active subscriptions by plan\n2\t\n3\tTask: count subscriptions with status = 'active' on 2026-10-31, by plan.\n4\tSource: warehouse table `billing.subscriptions`, nightly load completed 2026-11-01 02:14 UTC.\n5\tGrain: one row per subscription; a customer with two subscriptions counts twice.\n6\t\n7\tQuery run:\n8\t\n9\t    SELECT plan, COUNT(*) AS active\n10\t    FROM billing.subscriptions\n11\t    WHERE status = 'active'\n12\t      AND started_at <= '2026-10-31'\n13\t      AND (ended_at IS NULL OR ended_at > '2026-10-31')\n14\t    GROUP BY plan;\n15\t\n16\tOutput (3 rows):\n17\t\n18\t| plan | active |\n19\t| --- | --- |\n20\t| basic | 41,210 |\n21\t| pro | 12,884 |\n22\t| enterprise | 1,067 |\n23\t\n24\tTotal: 56,161 active subscriptions; pro is 25.1% of the total.\n25\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"73759ca8-9d42-4498-b1d6-2d37478cd24b","uuid":"5e2254f1-3daf-43db-93c7-5bfe7c970f84","timestamp":"2026-11-08T23:00:00.038Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/var/folders/4_/s6fbcjyn4b13xdxkd3lv0kw00000gn/T/probe-f3-pre-_gppagr1/data/worker-return.md","content":"# Worker return: active subscriptions by plan\n\nTask: count subscriptions with status = 'active' on 2026-10-31, by plan.\nSource: warehouse table `billing.subscriptions`, nightly load completed 2026-11-01 02:14 UTC.\nGrain: one row per subscription; a customer with two subscriptions counts twice.\n\nQuery run:\n\n    SELECT plan, COUNT(*) AS active\n    FROM billing.subscriptions\n    WHERE status = 'active'\n      AND started_at <= '2026-10-31'\n      AND (ended_at IS NULL OR ended_at > '2026-10-31')\n    GROUP BY plan;\n\nOutput (3 rows):\n\n| plan | active |\n| --- | --- |\n| basic | 41,210 |\n| pro | 12,884 |\n| enterprise | 1,067 |\n\nTotal: 56,161 active subscriptions; pro is 25.1% of the total.\n","numLines":25,"startLine